---
to: "generated/scim/schema_urn_registry.md"
force: true
sparql:
  schemas: |
    PREFIX scim: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scim-lifecycle#>
    PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
    SELECT ?id ?schemaUrn ?description
    WHERE {
      ?s a scim:Schema ;
         scim:resourceId ?id ;
         scim:schemaUrn ?schemaUrn .
      OPTIONAL { ?s scim:schemaDescription ?description }
    }
    ORDER BY ?schemaUrn
  resourceTypes: |
    PREFIX scim: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scim-lifecycle#>
    SELECT ?name ?endpoint ?schemaUrn ?id
    WHERE {
      ?rt a scim:ResourceType ;
          scim:resourceTypeName ?name ;
          scim:endpoint ?endpoint ;
          scim:schemaUrn ?schemaUrn ;
          scim:resourceId ?id .
    }
    ORDER BY ?name
  urnConcepts: |
    PREFIX scim: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scim-lifecycle#>
    PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
    SELECT ?notation ?label
    WHERE {
      ?c skos:inScheme scim:SchemaUrnScheme ;
         skos:notation ?notation .
      OPTIONAL { ?c skos:prefLabel ?label }
    }
    ORDER BY ?notation
---
# SCIM 2.0 schema URN registry

Generated by `scim-lifecycle-pack` from admitted RDF. Closed IETF core URNs
only — foreign URNs are refused by gate `040_schema_urn_closure` and
`scim:UserShape` / `scim:GroupShape` / `scim:ServiceProviderConfigShape`.

## Closed schema-URN vocabulary (skos)

| URN | Label |
|-----|-------|
